# CODEOWNERS for iGaming Platform Security
# Enforces mandatory security team review on sensitive file changes.
# Adapt team handles (@org/team-name) to your GitHub organization.

# Global -- security team reviews everything by default
* @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team

# CI/CD and pipeline definitions
.github/ @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
.github/workflows/ @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team

# Security configuration files
.checkov.yml @your-org/security-team @your-org/infrastructure-team
.pre-commit-config.yaml @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
sonar-project.properties @your-org/security-team @your-org/quality-team

# Infrastructure as Code
*.tf @your-org/infrastructure-team @your-org/security-team
*.tfvars @your-org/infrastructure-team @your-org/security-team
terraform/ @your-org/infrastructure-team @your-org/security-team

# Container and deployment files
Dockerfile* @your-org/devops-team @your-org/security-team
docker-compose* @your-org/devops-team @your-org/security-team
k8s/ @your-org/devops-team @your-org/security-team
helm/ @your-org/devops-team @your-org/security-team

# Security scripts and tools
setup-*.sh @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
install-*.sh @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team

# Environment and secrets (should rarely change)
.env* @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
**/secrets* @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
**/credentials* @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
**/keys* @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team

# Compliance and audit
compliance/ @your-org/compliance-team @your-org/security-team
policies/ @your-org/compliance-team @your-org/security-team

# Package management -- dependency changes need security review
requirements*.txt @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
package.json @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
go.mod @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team

# Database migrations
migrations/ @your-org/database-team @your-org/security-team
*.sql @your-org/database-team @your-org/security-team

# Payment processing code (PCI DSS scope)
payments/ @your-org/payments-team @your-org/security-team @your-org/compliance-team
billing/ @your-org/payments-team @your-org/security-team @your-org/compliance-team

# Player data handling (GDPR scope)
player/ @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team @your-org/compliance-team
kyc/ @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team @your-org/compliance-team
